#: scenario:scenario_2AFF8341_4A3E_430F_A1D6_31F2D481EF83
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8b3f7035225751249bd8c726967ad25d481051bd589f909ecd6249591fb0b21c
#. default-sha256: 18b1e2fa81de24d577d9836cc4ebfc21d4f241b2df3f3515eb74cd81763c5c51
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2AFF8341_4A3E_430F_A1D6_31F2D481EF83"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The crestfallen young man faded into the distance, and the decrepit double doors "
"clacked shut."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫那个被悲伤击垮的青年的身影消失了。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫出现在「⟪k:4⟫你⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫死者⟪k:7⟫」眼前的，"
"⟪k:8⟫只有一扇紧闭着的、破碎不堪的门扉。"

#: scenario:scenario_43A49B46_7AAD_44A2_B999_45334FEA1E47
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 55a93df47eaa3491d2df9b798695941430e10efc3bfa9022f476f9c8d2e1eac0
#. default-sha256: de8b89b7a53a89dfce3ea03f037792cba25220a6d53950348892e44dc842cfcf
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_43A49B46_7AAD_44A2_B999_45334FEA1E47"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Through the shattered glass, ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫the Departed⟪k:3⟫ could see only the ruins of a "
"garden, not a single rose growing within. ⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫You⟪k:6⟫He⟪k:7⟫ had evidently returned from "
"the past."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫破碎的门饰玻璃外，⟪k:1⟫蔷薇花园，⟪k:2⟫重新变回一片凋零和荒芜——⟪k:3⟫不知不觉之中，⟪k:4⟫「⟪k:5⟫"
"你⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫死者⟪k:8⟫」回到了原先的世界。"

#: scenario:scenario_0FB3F01D_B617_4D13_8095_F4F8541039DF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6b8ae66095cfb158f2634bee1533c80d1d3e0f5dafe4c9c95f0f1a998c754111
#. default-sha256: 9496ddf240fea55e6b00302ccdb3400dbd7171c9a15010a21f226bcb67e46d3e
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_0FB3F01D_B617_4D13_8095_F4F8541039DF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫In the garden, weeds grew taller than people. ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫He⟪k:3⟫ found it difficult to "
"look at. ⟪k:4⟫A wolf howled in the distance."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫眼前的凋零的花园之上，⟪k:1⟫只留下茂密的杂草在微微摇动着。⟪k:2⟫偶尔传来几声野狼的嚎叫。⟪k:3⟫除"
"此之外什么都不复存在。"

#: scenario:scenario_93B40010_CB1F_4857_8A6C_0EE53963A89B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 16c0d668c44619bbd42923bd6d91480b100d4218c87e33434cd6ee7e060037a8
#. default-sha256: 7a9e4ff6b465b3335fe3c91e7e908708a8227e1ca93b7cfd7c83d3cf232f6336
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_93B40010_CB1F_4857_8A6C_0EE53963A89B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The children, the sea of roses, and the White-Haired Girl were nowhere to be found."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫——没有那对年幼兄妹的欢声笑语、⟪k:1⟫没有盛开满园的蔷薇花、⟪k:2⟫没有白色长发的少女。"

#: scenario:scenario_86CD0575_B690_4CCE_B840_8CAD4CBE8F1B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 68463944add72d1d5a8d8aa57e5412db4ee279bfad1cf779eaa28920920d273d
#. default-sha256: f1374bf444ecd1da5e8071df930e77437bcab74d8d3903e25742b0e5d0c53464
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_86CD0575_B690_4CCE_B840_8CAD4CBE8F1B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫The Departed⟪k:3⟫ and the Maid who called ⟪k:4⟫You⟪k:5⟫him⟪k:6⟫ “Master” were "
"the only people present in the mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫只有「⟪k:1⟫你⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫死者⟪k:4⟫」，⟪k:5⟫以及称呼「⟪k:6⟫你⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫死者⟪k:9⟫」为「老爷」的女"
"仆。"

