#: scenario:scenario_648776E5_F044_473D_BE8E_A87D7B4CA23D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 44fa5f61dec570c13ce921d742343df8fbd7fc8933ee668109949e76862b9e4a
