msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫My, you cannot remember?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫It seems this is quite serious, then."
msgstr "哎呀，⟪k:0⟫您还是回想不起来吗？⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫似乎老爷您的问题，⟪k:3⟫比想象中还要严重。"

#: scenario:unlabelled:scenario_648776E5_F044_473D_BE8E_A87D7B4CA23D:1
