#: scenario:scenario_23DC6B01_83EC_42FB_8E1C_A0D23A5383B2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ee468b6e2a66fb201f35f9d8e95e90a17682bdd446dc917462676926b06ff35c
#. default-sha256: aab27fd72b40cf37517442597fc57099069a0de1a0defe279630fee8374da004
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_23DC6B01_83EC_42FB_8E1C_A0D23A5383B2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Worry not; my loyalty lies with you, Master.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫The mansion has witnessed "
"more yet.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Let us make our way to the second door."
msgstr ""
"不过无妨，⟪k:0⟫下仆是老爷您忠实的女仆。⟪k:1⟫让我们继续回顾这座「馆」的历史。⟪k:2⟫向下一扇门出发"
"吧。"

#: scenario:scenario_54842DC4_933A_4031_94E3_5E93C20311F1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4b067e60d17e4936b10a06ea498062df3d0889e54dd5f4c5ffdbefdfe0ee9688
#. default-sha256: 4de9b1896c74d0482ac56379998235ef5a0714e5f904c68291822da27c6b5ff9
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_54842DC4_933A_4031_94E3_5E93C20311F1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Your⟪k:13⟫The "
"Departed’s⟪k:14⟫ hand in hers, the Maid guided ⟪k:15⟫You⟪k:16⟫him⟪k:17⟫ back through the kitchen "
"and into the tea room. ⟪k:18⟫Her palms were still cold; ⟪k:19⟫You⟪k:20⟫the Departed⟪k:21⟫ felt as "
"though ⟪k:22⟫You⟪k:23⟫he⟪k:24⟫ were clenching ice."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫女仆再一次牵着「⟪k:12⟫你⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫"
"死者⟪k:15⟫」的手，⟪k:16⟫穿过了餐厅。⟪k:17⟫然后停在了一间饮茶室前。⟪k:18⟫「⟪k:19⟫你⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫死者"
"⟪k:22⟫」这时发现，女仆的手很冷，⟪k:23⟫仿佛自己握着一块冰一样。"

#: scenario:scenario_FE74AE6E_A77F_4DB7_8FCD_27355A2EB0FF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ecef4165a8a5474c45bc85dd28d0405645d75d3fa1db7f3535ea7627e176fa33
#. default-sha256: 46667702e30ae602eff782a18951c90e85743119f5a8438742fa0e622288fcab
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_FE74AE6E_A77F_4DB7_8FCD_27355A2EB0FF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Master, do you wish to know the truth no matter what may be hidden within?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫说起来，⟪k:3⟫老爷您觉得，⟪k:4⟫是无论真实如何，⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫都应该不顾一切去探知呢？"

#: scenario:scenario_E0DF12AB_4E49_4D99_9816_8E37338ABF6C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 337b6087f25753f7887799146bac149259ea62e0f5957e52ed1d809507f79ab7
#. default-sha256: 50ea5727341d7b41c2aba5d9fdb7f5f068df26d355600b48e3b895fddf6c3dcc
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E0DF12AB_4E49_4D99_9816_8E37338ABF6C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Or, if it is something you would be happier not knowing, would you rather remain in the "
"dark?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫还是说……不知道，⟪k:2⟫反而会更幸福一点呢？"

