msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Oh, is that so? Hehehe."
msgstr "啊……原来您是这么想的啊。⟪k:0⟫呵呵。"

#: scenario:scenario_DD82605B_296C_4B08_8924_289114001EE2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 35043d2cf44c59721eeadb36bffd0c3c7a309913e286778fed3fa92485885b78
#. default-sha256: b36eb0969848dec36d9886800d78636670e4c8b255f1d537ae2f9708f13d88fe
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_DD82605B_296C_4B08_8924_289114001EE2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I wonder about their father.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Yes, the flaxen-haired siblings’ father.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Do "
"you think he knew about the White-Haired Girl?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫那么，⟪k:1⟫那位父亲又如何呢？⟪k:2⟫下仆是说，⟪k:3⟫梅尔他们的父亲。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫您觉得他，⟪k:6⟫了"
"解那位白发少女的身份吗？"

#: scenario:unlabelled:scenario_DD82605B_296C_4B08_8924_289114001EE2:1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 31541eccc9aaa204dc0ad2adfccfaa5a033b7ada0da6d5c2200884b0cb36b38f
